00:55:49,137 --> 00:55:50,347
Come on up.

630
00:55:51,306 --> 00:55:52,390
Come on.

631
00:55:52,474 --> 00:55:53,517
Thanks.

632
00:55:56,812 --> 00:55:58,271
Nice out here, huh?

633
00:55:59,147 --> 00:56:00,899
Yeah, it's a nice view.

634
00:56:01,817 --> 00:56:03,443
